     "pin": "1",
     "name": "CLKIN",
     "type": "input",
     "function": "Reference clock input to the PLL; its clock is what the outputs copy. It needs a steady frequency and phase for the loop to lock, and after power-up with a valid clock present the loop takes up to 100 µs to lock."
    },
    {
     "pin": "2",
